  (ThomsonCompact.Target.targetCoeffsU ThomsonCompact.Target.Cells.finited14c23.c ThomsonCompact.Target.Bench.finited14c23.P [1, 6, 4, 2, 2] ThomsonCompact.Target.Bench.finited14c23.sT ThomsonCompact.Target.Bench.finited14c23.A).getD (j.val + 1) zeroTM
